<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT - GCC raised to strong buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - GCC raised to strong buy.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokerage house Interacciones said on Tuesday that it had upgraded cement company Grupo Cementos de Chihuahua (GCC) to a strong buy from a buy.</p>
<p>- &quot;Once again we are improving our recommendation for shares of GCC from a buy to a strong buy,&quot; the company said in a report.</p>
<p>- &quot;The valuation and perspectives for growth are excellent...,&quot; the company said.</p>
<p>- In late February, Interacciones raised its rating to a buy from a hold.</p>
<p>- The shares were unchanged at 8.50 pesos at mid-day on Tuesday.</p>
<p>((--Robert Kozak, Mexico City newsroom (525) 728 9559))</p>
</text>
